  "complexity": 4,
  "title": "Enforce the Planner handover threshold: the prompt hook tells the Planner to hand over once its context passes [planner].handover_context_tokens",
  "spec": "Why: usage analysis 2026-10-01: 16 interactive Planner sessions used 3.70B tokens (about $1,451 list price, 56% of all Claude spend vs $1,019 for every worker and decision Planner). Median context per call was 520-590k and 92-93% of calls exceeded 150k, because [planner].handover_context_tokens (150000 in .orchestrator/pool.toml) is read by nothing: its only reference is a message string at orchestrator/handover.py:244.\nWhat:\n- New orchestrator/planner_context.py: context_tokens(config_dir: Path, root: Path) -> int | None reads the newest *.jsonl under config_dir/projects/<pool.encode_project_dir(root)>/ (reuse the existing encoder in pool.py; do not duplicate it), finds the last line whose message has a usage dict and returns input_tokens + cache_read_input_tokens + cache_creation_input_tokens. Read the file from the end (seek) so a 100 MB transcript stays fast. hook_message(cfg, config_dir, root) -> str | None.\n- cli.py: `orchestrator planner-context [--hook]` prints the size, or with --hook only the one-line instruction when over the threshold. config_dir comes from CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, else ~/.claude.\n- .claude/hooks/planner-prompt.sh: after the existing reminder line, run the command with a 3 s timeout and print its output; any failure prints nothing (fail open). Keep the early exits for workers, ORCH_PLANNER_MODE=0 and slash commands unchanged.\nKeep the hook fast: one uv invocation per user prompt at most.\n\nWork on the task branch cut from goal/T-1403. Commit first, then run the focused tests in the foreground; never background a command and never run the full gate. Acceptance ids are tests/<file>.py::<method name>; write tests as unittest.TestCase methods using tests/_harness.py like the neighbouring tests.",
  "inputs": [],
  "acceptance": [
    "tests/test_planner_context.py::test_context_tokens_from_latest_transcript passes: given a fake config dir with projects/<encoded root>/<session>.jsonl, context_tokens returns input_tokens + cache_read_input_tokens + cache_creation_input_tokens of the last assistant message of the newest transcript, and None when there is none",
    "tests/test_planner_context.py::test_hook_message_over_threshold passes: `orchestrator planner-context --hook` prints one line naming the context size, the threshold and the command `uv run orchestrator handover --reason context` when context >= [planner].handover_context_tokens, and prints nothing below it or when no transcript exists",
    "tests/test_hooks.py planner-prompt tests still pass (the existing reminder line is unchanged; the new line is appended only over the threshold)",
    ".claude/hooks/tests-green.sh wt/THIS-TASK exits 0"
  ],
